[
  {
    "text": "So",
    "start": 0.16,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "hello everyone and welcome",
    "start": 2.96,
    "duration": 7.679
  },
  {
    "text": "into this morning meditation",
    "start": 6.64,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "and something unique",
    "start": 10.639,
    "duration": 4.561
  },
  {
    "text": "I think wonderful",
    "start": 13.2,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "very important happens in",
    "start": 15.2,
    "duration": 6.68
  },
  {
    "text": "can happen in meditation",
    "start": 18.16,
    "duration": 3.72
  },
  {
    "text": "and that is",
    "start": 22.4,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "with your eyes closed perhaps sitting",
    "start": 25.039,
    "duration": 7.121
  },
  {
    "text": "centered on yourself Here",
    "start": 28.24,
    "duration": 7.92
  },
  {
    "text": "that you yourself as a meditator, as an",
    "start": 32.16,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "existing person, a living breathing",
    "start": 36.16,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "person",
    "start": 39.12,
    "duration": 4.32
  },
  {
    "text": "becomes for these few minutes the most",
    "start": 40.96,
    "duration": 6.84
  },
  {
    "text": "important person in the world.",
    "start": 43.44,
    "duration": 4.36
  },
  {
    "text": "Not as a form of conceit.",
    "start": 47.84,
    "duration": 6.239
  },
  {
    "text": "The opposite of conceit. Conceit",
    "start": 51.039,
    "duration": 6.68
  },
  {
    "text": "diminishes us.",
    "start": 54.079,
    "duration": 3.64
  },
  {
    "text": "but rather that there's a way in which",
    "start": 59.199,
    "duration": 7.321
  },
  {
    "text": "the whole world",
    "start": 62.8,
    "duration": 3.72
  },
  {
    "text": "our world that we live in begins with",
    "start": 66.56,
    "duration": 4.559
  },
  {
    "text": "ourselves.",
    "start": 68.799,
    "duration": 5.801
  },
  {
    "text": "If the heart",
    "start": 71.119,
    "duration": 3.481
  },
  {
    "text": "or deep inside there's a light of love",
    "start": 74.88,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "or compassion",
    "start": 77.84,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "and if that light gets turned on if you",
    "start": 80.56,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "could slow down the speed of light",
    "start": 84.4,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "you'll see that it goes outwards first",
    "start": 86.72,
    "duration": 8.079
  },
  {
    "text": "and touches the edges of the heart",
    "start": 90.96,
    "duration": 7.199
  },
  {
    "text": "moves on into the torso spreads through",
    "start": 94.799,
    "duration": 6.561
  },
  {
    "text": "the body. The first thing that the love",
    "start": 98.159,
    "duration": 5.521
  },
  {
    "text": "encounters,",
    "start": 101.36,
    "duration": 4.719
  },
  {
    "text": "the light encounters is all the stuff",
    "start": 103.68,
    "duration": 7.2
  },
  {
    "text": "that's who you're a psychophysical being",
    "start": 106.079,
    "duration": 8.161
  },
  {
    "text": "and you're as important as any other",
    "start": 110.88,
    "duration": 7.599
  },
  {
    "text": "being. All beings are valuable",
    "start": 114.24,
    "duration": 7.6
  },
  {
    "text": "and you are valuable",
    "start": 118.479,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "and your awareness radiates your love",
    "start": 121.84,
    "duration": 8.08
  },
  {
    "text": "and it it runs into yourself first.",
    "start": 125.439,
    "duration": 7.281
  },
  {
    "text": "And if that if you limit that love, if",
    "start": 129.92,
    "duration": 5.679
  },
  {
    "text": "you diminish it right there as it passes",
    "start": 132.72,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "through you,",
    "start": 135.599,
    "duration": 6.441
  },
  {
    "text": "less is available for the world.",
    "start": 137.52,
    "duration": 4.52
  },
  {
    "text": "The state of your mind, how you are",
    "start": 143.28,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "has a lot to do with how you see the",
    "start": 147.599,
    "duration": 4.401
  },
  {
    "text": "world and how you relate to the world",
    "start": 150.08,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "and even how you might help create a",
    "start": 152.0,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "better world.",
    "start": 155.36,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "See with hostility, see with ill will,",
    "start": 157.76,
    "duration": 7.199
  },
  {
    "text": "see with desires,",
    "start": 161.68,
    "duration": 5.839
  },
  {
    "text": "greedy desires.",
    "start": 164.959,
    "duration": 5.201
  },
  {
    "text": "And you'll see a world that is colored",
    "start": 167.519,
    "duration": 5.761
  },
  {
    "text": "by those things.",
    "start": 170.16,
    "duration": 6.4
  },
  {
    "text": "See a world without greedy desires,",
    "start": 173.28,
    "duration": 9.28
  },
  {
    "text": "without ill will, without any hostility.",
    "start": 176.56,
    "duration": 7.92
  },
  {
    "text": "And our world will not only look",
    "start": 182.56,
    "duration": 4.959
  },
  {
    "text": "different but we contribute to a better",
    "start": 184.48,
    "duration": 7.399
  },
  {
    "text": "world, a fuller world.",
    "start": 187.519,
    "duration": 4.36
  },
  {
    "text": "Meditation is not a simple step towards",
    "start": 195.68,
    "duration": 5.279
  },
  {
    "text": "stress reduction.",
    "start": 198.72,
    "duration": 4.159
  },
  {
    "text": "It's not so we just can feel a little",
    "start": 200.959,
    "duration": 4.321
  },
  {
    "text": "calmer.",
    "start": 202.879,
    "duration": 5.681
  },
  {
    "text": "I'd like to suggest for this meditation",
    "start": 205.28,
    "duration": 6.319
  },
  {
    "text": "that it is a radical",
    "start": 208.56,
    "duration": 6.039
  },
  {
    "text": "revolutionary",
    "start": 211.599,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "stance position",
    "start": 214.879,
    "duration": 6.121
  },
  {
    "text": "revolutionary",
    "start": 218.0,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "that weighs it undermines or",
    "start": 221.04,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "offers a radical alternative",
    "start": 224.48,
    "duration": 8.52
  },
  {
    "text": "to business as usual in this world.",
    "start": 227.92,
    "duration": 5.08
  },
  {
    "text": "So meditation is a response to the",
    "start": 233.12,
    "duration": 5.36
  },
  {
    "text": "world.",
    "start": 236.64,
    "duration": 3.92
  },
  {
    "text": "It's a mature,",
    "start": 238.48,
    "duration": 3.679
  },
  {
    "text": "dedicated,",
    "start": 240.56,
    "duration": 6.44
  },
  {
    "text": "clear, invaluable time",
    "start": 242.159,
    "duration": 4.841
  },
  {
    "text": "to be the alternative to greed, hate,",
    "start": 247.599,
    "duration": 5.601
  },
  {
    "text": "and delusion.",
    "start": 251.2,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "You are important.",
    "start": 253.2,
    "duration": 7.759
  },
  {
    "text": "So to sit and meditate this time, not to",
    "start": 256.72,
    "duration": 7.36
  },
  {
    "text": "be stressed, not to strain,",
    "start": 260.959,
    "duration": 8.121
  },
  {
    "text": "but to be inspired, delighted",
    "start": 264.08,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "that it's invaluable",
    "start": 270.32,
    "duration": 7.4
  },
  {
    "text": "to sit here practicing,",
    "start": 273.36,
    "duration": 4.36
  },
  {
    "text": "letting go of any hostility",
    "start": 280.72,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "that might arise in the mind including",
    "start": 284.88,
    "duration": 4.4
  },
  {
    "text": "to yourself.",
    "start": 286.96,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "Letting go of any ill will",
    "start": 289.28,
    "duration": 7.28
  },
  {
    "text": "including to yourself.",
    "start": 293.44,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "Letting go of any greed,",
    "start": 296.56,
    "duration": 8.52
  },
  {
    "text": "any lust, any strong desire.",
    "start": 300.0,
    "duration": 5.08
  },
  {
    "text": "and to do so as a way of",
    "start": 306.72,
    "duration": 4.919
  },
  {
    "text": "being here",
    "start": 312.8,
    "duration": 3.48
  },
  {
    "text": "in a full revolutionary way.",
    "start": 317.6,
    "duration": 7.12
  },
  {
    "text": "If you want to see the world change,",
    "start": 321.68,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "change the person who's closest to you,",
    "start": 324.72,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "care for it. Be careful.",
    "start": 328.16,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "Meet the person that's closest to you,",
    "start": 331.28,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "yourself,",
    "start": 333.36,
    "duration": 5.839
  },
  {
    "text": "with goodwill,",
    "start": 336.0,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "genuine goodwill.",
    "start": 339.199,
    "duration": 5.361
  },
  {
    "text": "Goodwill that arises from the depths of",
    "start": 342.16,
    "duration": 5.039
  },
  {
    "text": "your being.",
    "start": 344.56,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "Meet this person closest to you,",
    "start": 347.199,
    "duration": 5.081
  },
  {
    "text": "yourself,",
    "start": 349.28,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "with compassion and love",
    "start": 352.96,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "that also arises from the depths of your",
    "start": 356.96,
    "duration": 4.079
  },
  {
    "text": "being.",
    "start": 359.44,
    "duration": 5.36
  },
  {
    "text": "This is invaluable.",
    "start": 361.039,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "This time now these next minutes are",
    "start": 364.8,
    "duration": 6.119
  },
  {
    "text": "precious.",
    "start": 367.919,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Assuming a meditation posture.",
    "start": 372.56,
    "duration": 4.44
  },
  {
    "text": "assuming a posture that",
    "start": 379.919,
    "duration": 4.28
  },
  {
    "text": "respects the magnitude",
    "start": 384.639,
    "duration": 5.201
  },
  {
    "text": "of the work that we're doing in",
    "start": 387.68,
    "duration": 4.639
  },
  {
    "text": "meditation",
    "start": 389.84,
    "duration": 7.88
  },
  {
    "text": "that respects it that cares for you.",
    "start": 392.319,
    "duration": 5.401
  },
  {
    "text": "Gently closing the eyes",
    "start": 398.639,
    "duration": 4.441
  },
  {
    "text": "and to settle into this moment",
    "start": 413.52,
    "duration": 7.679
  },
  {
    "text": "to settle in",
    "start": 418.4,
    "duration": 7.68
  },
  {
    "text": "here with this person yourself.",
    "start": 421.199,
    "duration": 10.44
  },
  {
    "text": "Taking a few long, slow, deep breaths.",
    "start": 426.08,
    "duration": 5.559
  },
  {
    "text": "Relaxing as you exhale.",
    "start": 448.88,
    "duration": 4.28
  },
  {
    "text": "letting your breathing return to normal.",
    "start": 465.199,
    "duration": 4.761
  },
  {
    "text": "And on the exhales,",
    "start": 474.4,
    "duration": 3.72
  },
  {
    "text": "soften, relax in your body.",
    "start": 478.479,
    "duration": 5.16
  },
  {
    "text": "A relaxing, softening",
    "start": 484.24,
    "duration": 4.2
  },
  {
    "text": "that connects you more to now. And here.",
    "start": 490.879,
    "duration": 5.72
  },
  {
    "text": "relaxing the thinking mind.",
    "start": 533.519,
    "duration": 4.521
  },
  {
    "text": "Softening",
    "start": 538.08,
    "duration": 6.319
  },
  {
    "text": "the deep emotional tensions, tightness,",
    "start": 540.8,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "pressure.",
    "start": 544.399,
    "duration": 2.961
  },
  {
    "text": "and then from the depths of your being",
    "start": 570.16,
    "duration": 5.32
  },
  {
    "text": "can you awaken",
    "start": 576.16,
    "duration": 6.28
  },
  {
    "text": "good will, kindness,",
    "start": 578.24,
    "duration": 4.2
  },
  {
    "text": "compassion,",
    "start": 583.44,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Love",
    "start": 585.44,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "that at a minimum",
    "start": 590.399,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "takes the form of wanting to have con",
    "start": 593.519,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "kindness and love,",
    "start": 597.279,
    "duration": 5.361
  },
  {
    "text": "wishing it was here.",
    "start": 599.839,
    "duration": 7.801
  },
  {
    "text": "That itself is an expression of love.",
    "start": 602.64,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And from the depth of your being",
    "start": 608.88,
    "duration": 4.519
  },
  {
    "text": "with a reference point of goodwill,",
    "start": 614.959,
    "duration": 7.32
  },
  {
    "text": "compassion,",
    "start": 619.279,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "sit and meditate,",
    "start": 622.64,
    "duration": 3.639
  },
  {
    "text": "letting go",
    "start": 627.92,
    "duration": 3.4
  },
  {
    "text": "of any ill will,",
    "start": 631.519,
    "duration": 6.921
  },
  {
    "text": "any hostility,",
    "start": 635.04,
    "duration": 3.4
  },
  {
    "text": "any strong desire",
    "start": 638.64,
    "duration": 4.04
  },
  {
    "text": "that interferes",
    "start": 643.44,
    "duration": 3.399
  },
  {
    "text": "with the light of goodwill, the light of",
    "start": 648.959,
    "duration": 4.801
  },
  {
    "text": "love,",
    "start": 651.76,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "care,",
    "start": 653.76,
    "duration": 5.8
  },
  {
    "text": "kindness.",
    "start": 656.56,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "writing on each inhale and each exhale.",
    "start": 661.36,
    "duration": 5.56
  },
  {
    "text": "Where the meeting",
    "start": 675.76,
    "duration": 6.319
  },
  {
    "text": "of inhale and awareness",
    "start": 678.48,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "is a meeting of care.",
    "start": 682.079,
    "duration": 6.921
  },
  {
    "text": "Love",
    "start": 686.0,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "where the meeting point of awareness",
    "start": 689.76,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "with the exhale",
    "start": 692.0,
    "duration": 8.959
  },
  {
    "text": "is a meeting of love and care, kindness,",
    "start": 694.64,
    "duration": 9.04
  },
  {
    "text": "as if this is the most important thing",
    "start": 700.959,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "to do right now.",
    "start": 703.68,
    "duration": 3.279
  },
  {
    "text": "to be present",
    "start": 707.839,
    "duration": 3.56
  },
  {
    "text": "without any ill will,",
    "start": 711.76,
    "duration": 4.12
  },
  {
    "text": "without being caught in desire.",
    "start": 715.92,
    "duration": 7.32
  },
  {
    "text": "Just here.",
    "start": 719.839,
    "duration": 3.401
  },
  {
    "text": "The chances are",
    "start": 1097.84,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "that if you're thinking a lot in",
    "start": 1101.2,
    "duration": 4.92
  },
  {
    "text": "meditation,",
    "start": 1103.12,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "your thoughts have nothing to do",
    "start": 1106.16,
    "duration": 4.68
  },
  {
    "text": "with how valuable it is to care for",
    "start": 1111.6,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "yourself right now",
    "start": 1114.559,
    "duration": 8.601
  },
  {
    "text": "as you are in the present.",
    "start": 1117.6,
    "duration": 5.56
  },
  {
    "text": "That this time now",
    "start": 1123.2,
    "duration": 4.68
  },
  {
    "text": "is the only time",
    "start": 1127.919,
    "duration": 3.961
  },
  {
    "text": "to be present for yourself",
    "start": 1131.919,
    "duration": 4.441
  },
  {
    "text": "with kind awareness,",
    "start": 1136.799,
    "duration": 3.961
  },
  {
    "text": "to fill yourself",
    "start": 1141.6,
    "duration": 3.8
  },
  {
    "text": "With being aware,",
    "start": 1148.96,
    "duration": 8.92
  },
  {
    "text": "free of desire and ill will.",
    "start": 1152.32,
    "duration": 5.56
  },
  {
    "text": "And whatever is difficult, whatever",
    "start": 1386.88,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "is there's not good will,",
    "start": 1390.88,
    "duration": 7.56
  },
  {
    "text": "not compassion.",
    "start": 1394.88,
    "duration": 3.56
  },
  {
    "text": "It's okay.",
    "start": 1399.679,
    "duration": 8.081
  },
  {
    "text": "Meet that with good will,",
    "start": 1403.039,
    "duration": 8.721
  },
  {
    "text": "with love, care.",
    "start": 1407.76,
    "duration": 8.6
  },
  {
    "text": "Find the deepest place within",
    "start": 1411.76,
    "duration": 4.6
  },
  {
    "text": "from which",
    "start": 1418.24,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "you can meet all things",
    "start": 1421.28,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "with kindness,",
    "start": 1424.32,
    "duration": 7.0
  },
  {
    "text": "love, hair.",
    "start": 1427.36,
    "duration": 3.96
  },
  {
    "text": "And as we come to the end of this",
    "start": 1530.64,
    "duration": 5.24
  },
  {
    "text": "sitting,",
    "start": 1532.88,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "if you can imagine Imagine that there's",
    "start": 1536.96,
    "duration": 5.44
  },
  {
    "text": "a small light",
    "start": 1539.279,
    "duration": 7.721
  },
  {
    "text": "deep at the center of your being.",
    "start": 1542.4,
    "duration": 4.6
  },
  {
    "text": "A small light of love or compassion,",
    "start": 1547.44,
    "duration": 6.359
  },
  {
    "text": "care,",
    "start": 1553.919,
    "duration": 4.841
  },
  {
    "text": "good will.",
    "start": 1555.52,
    "duration": 3.24
  },
